  <item>
    <title>Clarendon County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/clarendon-county-sc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-clarendon-county-sc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Ordinance 2026-18: six-month pause on land-use and development approvals for data centers and battery energy storage systems outside Industrial I and II zones; does not stop Project 59 in the industrial park. Passed third and final reading unanimously (scheduled for the Sept 14 regular meeting; local outlets do not state the date outright, so Sep 14 is inferred from the meeting schedule and a Sept 14-18 roundup). No ordinance text or minutes read; effective date and end date not stated in sources.</description>
  </item>
